[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    423[0m:[38;5;10m[49m }
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    424[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    425[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// Row 18: exhaustive short lengths, randomized content per length.
